WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I’m Christopher Han, co-founder of KICE Arena.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
I connect product development with the people who use it.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
With Codex, I explore and implement. I own experiment design and verification.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
I’ll bring developers, founders and creators together across communities.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
My first contribution: a Korean Codex workshop and visual guides anyone can follow.
